{"metadata":{"externalID":"PersistentTrees","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"PersistentTrees"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"PersistentTrees"},"abstract":[{"text":"Balanced search trees that keep every version, sharing structure between them.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Sets-and-dictionaries","title":"Sets and dictionaries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeSet","doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeDictionary"]},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/Trees"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/persistenttrees"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeSet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeDictionary","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" never changes a vertex once it is made."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An edit builds new vertices along the path from the root to the change, O(log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") of them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"points them at the untouched subtrees of the version it started from. Every earlier version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays as it was, and a history of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" edits costs O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") space in all."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import PersistentTrees","","let empty = PersistentTreeSet<Int>()","let one = empty.inserting(5)","let two = one.inserting(3)","let three = two.removing(5)","Array(one)                         \/\/ [5]","Array(two)                         \/\/ [3, 5]","Array(three)                       \/\/ [3]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The trees are weight-balanced: neither subtree of a vertex holds more than three times the keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the other. Union, intersection, difference and symmetric difference split one tree by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s root and join the halves, in O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + 1)) for sets of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ≤ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" elements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a subtree both operands share is kept whole without being visited. Two versions a few edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apart therefore merge in time proportional to those edits."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A version converts to Grafluent’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryTree"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryTree(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", its elements or keys as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://PersistentTrees/documentation/PersistentTrees":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees","abstract":[{"text":"Balanced search trees that keep every version, sharing structure between them.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"PersistentTrees","url":"\/documentation\/persistenttrees"},"doc://PersistentTrees/documentation/PersistentTrees/PersistentTreeSet":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PersistentTreeSet","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PersistentTreeSet","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistenttrees\/persistenttreeset","title":"PersistentTreeSet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent sorted set: unique elements in ascending order, where every version stays usable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and versions share all but the vertices their edits touched."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeSet","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://PersistentTrees/documentation/PersistentTrees/PersistentTreeDictionary":{"title":"PersistentTreeDictionary","identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeDictionary","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistentTreeDictionary"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistentTreeDictionary"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent sorted dictionary: unique keys in ascending order, each with a value, where every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version stays usable and versions share all but the vertices their edits touched."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/persistenttrees\/persistenttreedictionary","type":"topic"},"doc://PersistentTrees/documentation/PersistentTrees/Trees":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/persistenttrees\/trees","identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/Trees","title":"Trees","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol"}}}